  "en": "Touya: Oh, r-right...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 228,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:00111",
  "jp": "カスミ「いらっしゃい。今ね、ちょうどトウヤちゃんのとこへ{nl}　行こうと思ってたんだ」",
  "off": 273,
  "len": 47,
  "en": "Kasumi: Welcome. You know, I was just about to go to your room, Touya-chan.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 275,
  "text_len": 44
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:00143",
  "jp": "トウヤ「え？」",
  "off": 323,
  "len": 11,
  "en": "Touya: Huh?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 325,
  "text_len": 8
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:00151",
  "jp": "カスミ「実はシスクさんからクッキーをもらって。{nl}　これがすごく美味しいんだ。{nl}　だからトウヤちゃんと一緒に食べようと思って‥‥」",
  "off": 337,
  "len": 77,
  "en": "Kasumi: Actually, I got some cookies from Sisk-san. They're really delicious. So I thought I'd eat them together with you, Touya-chan...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 339,
  "text_len": 74
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:001A1",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そ、そうか‥‥」",
  "off": 417,
  "len": 17,
  "en": "Touya: I-I see...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 419,
  "text_len": 14
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:001B5",
  "jp": "カスミ「‥‥クッキー嫌いじゃなかったよね？」",
