  "len": 30,
  "en": "Kasumi: ...You don't hate cookies, right?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 439,
  "text_len": 27
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:001D3",
  "jp": "　ああ。食べようぜ{nl}　実は嫌いなんだ",
  "off": 467,
  "len": 24,
  "en": "Yeah. Let's eat{nl}Actually, I hate cookies",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 128,
  "text_off": 469,
  "text_len": 21
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:001F4",
  "jp": "カスミ「うん！　ちょっと待っててね。{nl}　今、お茶も用意するから」",
  "off": 500,
  "len": 41,
  "en": "Kasumi: Okay! Wait just a moment. I'll make some tea, too.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 502,
  "text_len": 38
 },
 {
  "id": "sce085:00235",
  "jp": "　それから俺達は昔話をしながら{nl}　語らいの時を過ごした‥‥",
  "off": 565,
  "len": 41,
  "en": "After that, we spent the time talking about the old days...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 567,
  "text_len": 38
 },
